          "`KylesLambdaModel.calculate_lambda(cov_price_orderflow, var_orderflow)` computes that exact univariate OLS regression slope without spurious intercept terms. Guarding `if var_orderflow <= 0: return 0.0` provides essential defensive stability whenever market data freezes during circuit breakers, halted tickers, or replay intervals containing zero trade variance.",
