          "Tuning `forgetting_factor` governs the exact responsiveness-versus-noise frontier. Setting `lam_decay = 0.95` discounts older trades aggressively (effective half-life around 14 ticks), snapping rapidly onto steepening price impact; setting `lam_decay = 0.995` averages across hundreds of prints for calm, noise-resistant index ETFs. Notice also that `self.lam_decay + self.p_cov * x * x` remains strictly positive as long as `lam_decay > 0` and `p_cov >= 0`.",
          "Observing the four streamed trades at `lam_decay=0.95` confirms smooth upward adaptation from prior `theta = 0.0001`: `(1000, 0.05)` updates `theta` to `5e-05` (`0.00005`), `(1500, 0.12)` lifts it to `7.1e-05`, `(2000, 0.18)` reaches `8.2e-05`, and `(3000, 0.35)` reaches `0.000102`—adapting smoothly in `O(1)` per trade with zero historical storage. Inspecting how `RecursiveLeastSquaresLambda.update` incorporates exponentially damped squared signed volume demonstrates numerical elegance under strict real-time latency constraints. Starting cleanly from prior beliefs and streaming `(1000, 0.05) -> 5e-05` through `(1500, 0.12) -> 7.1e-05` and up to `0.000102`, forgetting factor tuning balances noise rejection against fast regime adaptation during volatile afternoon trading sessions. Choosing `lam_decay` close to `0.98` yields smooth stable slopes across quiet consolidation weeks, whereas lowering decay toward `0.90` lets execution models respond within minutes after liquidity depth vanishes during sudden macro volatility spikes! Notice carefully why regularization priors protect early updates: initialization with nonzero baseline denominator variance keeps single tiny opening trades from whipping `theta` erratically toward extreme magnitudes. Production unit suites validate invariance on zero-volume no-op ticks, verify monotonic tightening as consistent positive `(Q, dP)` prints arrive, clamp pathological negative or extreme noise outliers cleanly against hard safety floors, and benchmark `O(1)` streaming updates against batch weighted least-squares regressions over multi-week tick streams to prove zero numerical divergence after thousands of consecutive steps. Equally valuable in live execution monitoring is tracking step-by-step prediction residuals (`dP - lambda * signed_vol`) alongside updated slope `theta`: sudden residual spikes immediately diagnose illiquid order-book vacuums or scheduled macroeconomic announcements. Ensuring strict positivity clamps on covariance denominators guarantees immunity against rare zero-volume consolidated tape intervals across illiquid small-cap listings. Replicating batch offline OLS estimates cleanly against recursive O(1) weights confirms forgetting-factor stability over extended multi-month regimes. Production regression scripts check both calm consolidation days and FOMC volatility bursts deterministically before releasing updated decay tuning parameters onto live smart order routers.",
