          "`PostTradeTCA.evaluate_implementation_shortfall(order_side, arrival_price, avg_exec_price, predicted_impact_bps)` standardizes shortfall across both sides cleanly using `side_mult = 1 if order_side.upper() == 'BUY' else -1`. Multiplying `side_mult * (avg_exec_price - arrival_price)` guarantees positive `realized_drag_dollars` always represents adverse slippage—paying higher on buys or selling lower on sells—while price improvement records as negative cost.",
