          "Inspect mathematical monotonicity guaranteeing uniqueness cleanly: for every strictly valid arbitrage-free European option above intrinsic lower bound, `Vega` remains strictly positive (`dC/d_sigma > 0`), making `C(sigma)` strictly increasing and ensuring every market quote corresponds to at most one unique implied volatility root!",
